1
00:00:08,842 --> 00:00:10,802
What's going on?

2
00:00:10,802 --> 00:00:13,263
Something's off.

3
00:00:13,263 --> 00:00:15,390
It's nothing.

4
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:16,599
Really? You sure
there's nothing going on?

5
00:00:16,599 --> 00:00:19,602
Really. I'm fine.

6
00:00:21,146 --> 00:00:22,147
Did I do something wrong...

7
00:00:22,147 --> 00:00:24,149
No.

8
00:00:30,321 --> 00:00:32,699
Sorry.

9
00:00:32,699 --> 00:00:35,702
Just... not feeling
great lately.

10
00:00:45,795 --> 00:00:48,590
Don't you think Seung-hyun has

11
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:50,925
been acting strange lately?

12
00:00:50,925 --> 00:00:53,762
Yeah.

13
00:00:53,762 --> 00:00:56,723
His condition's deteriorating

14
00:00:56,723 --> 00:00:58,516
and I've got a bad feeling.

15
00:00:58,516 --> 00:01:02,395
You don't think he's...
training somewhere else?

16
00:01:02,395 --> 00:01:05,690
No way...
I mean, he wouldn't...

17
00:01:12,781 --> 00:01:15,909
I think this is too risky.

18
00:01:15,909 --> 00:01:18,661
You think Ji-sung would be
happy seeing you like this?

19
00:01:18,661 --> 00:01:20,497
Keep going!

20
00:01:45,563 --> 00:01:47,107
Crap... this looks bad.

21
00:01:47,107 --> 00:01:50,110
I think it's a serious injury.
